# Internal working material that was being served from the public site. Found 2026-10-22: /design/audit
# (an internal security dashboard that still called a fixed finding "LIVE NOW"), the published rules, the
# SQL schemas and the planning data under /docs were all readable by anyone. Nothing shipped fetches from
